## 5. 

Feature: Betslip Keypad Layout and CTA Placement A/B Test

  Background:
    Given the betslip is active with 1 single selection
    And the stake input field is currently empty

  # -----------------------------------------------------------
  # EXPERIMENT VARIANT ROUTING & TELEMETRY
  # -----------------------------------------------------------

  Scenario: User allocated to Variant A renders CTA above numeric grid
    Given the experiment flag "exp_betslip_keypad_cta_layout" is evaluated as "cta_above"
    When the user taps the stake field to focus
    Then the numeric keypad should display using the 3x4 grid layout
    And the "Place Bet" CTA button should be positioned above the numeric grid
    And the quick-stake chips should be positioned above the "Place Bet" CTA
    And an analytics event "betslip_opened" should emit with variant "cta_above"

  Scenario: User allocated to Variant B renders CTA below numeric grid
    Given the experiment flag "exp_betslip_keypad_cta_layout" is evaluated as "cta_below"
    When the user taps the stake field to focus
    Then the numeric keypad should display using the 3x4 grid layout
    And the "Place Bet" CTA button should be positioned directly below the numeric grid
    And the quick-stake chips should remain positioned directly above the numeric grid
    And an analytics event "betslip_opened" should emit with variant "cta_below"

  Scenario: User allocated to Control renders legacy 6x2 keypad with bottom-pinned CTA
    Given the experiment flag "exp_betslip_keypad_cta_layout" is evaluated as "control"
    When the user taps the stake field to focus
    Then the numeric keypad should display using the legacy 6x2 grid layout
    And the "Place Bet" CTA button should remain pinned to the bottom sheet safe area
    And an analytics event "betslip_opened" should emit with variant "control"

  # -----------------------------------------------------------
  # CORE KEYPAD INTERACTIONS & VALIDATION
  # -----------------------------------------------------------

  Scenario Outline: Numerical entry on standard 3x4 layout
    Given the experiment flag is active for a 3x4 variant
    When the user taps the sequence "<input>" on the keypad
    Then the stake field should display "<output>"
    And the "Place Bet" CTA should be enabled
    Examples:
      | input   | output |
      | 1,0     | 10     |
      | 5,.,5   | 5.5    |
      | .,7,5   | 0.75   |
      | 0,5     | 5      |

  Scenario: Decimal precision limit enforcement
    Given the experiment flag is active for a 3x4 variant
    And the stake field currently displays "10.55"
    When the user taps "5" on the numeric grid
    Then the stake field should remain "10.55"
    And no additional digit should be appended

  Scenario: Stake correction via single tap backspace
    Given the stake field currently displays "25"
    When the user taps the "⌫" backspace key once
    Then the stake field should display "2"
    And an analytics event "stake_cleared" should emit with source "single_tap"

  Scenario: Stake correction via long-press clear
    Given the stake field currently displays "150"
    When the user performs a long-press (>= 900ms) on the "⌫" backspace key
    Then the stake field should be cleared to empty
    And the "Place Bet" CTA button should transition to disabled
    And an analytics event "stake_cleared" should emit with source "long_press"

  Scenario: Quick stake increment updates value correctly
    Given the stake field currently displays "10"
    When the user taps the "+10" quick-stake chip
    Then the stake field should display "20"
    And an analytics event "quick_stake_selected" should emit with keyLabel "+10"

  # -----------------------------------------------------------
  # MARKET SUSPENSION & CTA STATE
  # -----------------------------------------------------------

  Scenario: Market suspension disables CTA across all variants
    Given the user is entering a stake on the keypad
    When the selection market transitions to "Suspended"
    Then the keypad should remain visible and interactive for stake editing
    But the "Place Bet" CTA button must be disabled with label "Market Suspended"

  # -----------------------------------------------------------
  # CONVERSION & SUBMISSION TELEMETRY
  # -----------------------------------------------------------

  Scenario: Triggering bet placement emits conversion telemetry
    Given the stake field contains valid input "20.00"
    And the "Place Bet" CTA is enabled
    When the user taps the "Place Bet" CTA button
    Then an analytics event "place_bet_triggered" should emit with stakeValue "20.00"
